
Analysis Description
--------------------
 Read a tree and (optionally) a list of sequence names, and annotate
branches for subsequent analyses that accept branch partitions. 

- __Requirements__: A tree to label. Existing tree labels will be respected, allowing for
multiple sets to be labeled

